From febd1cd3298b23192148328e91e4868ee2f03aa6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shriram K <shriram.k@arm.com>
Date: Fri, 5 Apr 2024 13:42:04 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] [TEMP] module/cmn_cyprus: extend support for 32 HTG regions

Initially only 8 System Cache Group (SCG)/Hashed Target Group (HTG)
regions were supported in the CMN Cyprus driver. Extend the support from
8 to 32 SCG/HTG regions.

Signed-off-by: Shriram K <shriram.k@arm.com>
Change-Id: Ic65966666c68ed54b89bd4f90049db168afa3883

Signed-off-by: Jon Mason <jon.mason@arm.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
